I have found a possible way to get gold without doing much work.  I
polymorphed my dog into a dragon while we were both inside a room
with many objects in it.  I tossed all of my gold to my dragon.  It
said he caught it, and I used my stethoscope to verify this.  He did.

Next, I followed him around as he randomly picked up and dropped
things.  Sometimes, for no apparant reason, there would be a large
pile of gold where he set something down.  I picked up this gold and
then applied the stethoscope again.  He still had the gold I gave
him, so I tossed him the gold I just picked up.

I repeated this several times and eventually built up a large cache
of gold.  My dragon has several hundred thousand gold pieces, but
tends to leave about 10000 in random places after I toss him a few.
Sometimes he leaves more than one stack and I have been able to get
up to 40000 gold this way.

I haven't tried this with very many other animals, but it doesn't
work on dogs, elementals or demons.

Is this a known "feature" or have I stumpled onto something new?

